MONITOR ALT / SPEAKER SWITCHING
No monitor_alt or monitor_alt_enable transition occurred in reportVersion 6. Both remain EVAL_ONLY_SAFE_ACTIONABLE.

Official Focusrite documentation cross-checked on 2026-08-26 confirms for Scarlett 18i20 3rd Gen:
- MAIN = Monitor Outputs 1-2;
- ALT = Line Outputs 3-4;
- Speaker Switching moves/copies the monitor mix between the two pairs;
- the inactive pair is muted;
- disabling Speaker Switching initially mutes MAIN + ALT for safety;
- ALT can be selected from Focusrite Control or the front-panel ALT button.

Therefore: if ALT actions remain public for v1, run ONE physically isolated exact-restorable ALT/ALT Enable test. Otherwise withhold them. Do not test with active loud monitoring.

